Package: wallpaper-rs
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: shuying-code <shuying-code@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/shuying-code/wallpaper-rs
Depends: libc6, libgtk-3-0 | libgtk-3-0t64, libgl1, libxkbcommon0, libx11-6, libxi6, libxcursor1, libxrandr2, libxinerama1
Description: Wallpaper Studio - cross-platform desktop wallpaper app
 Built with Rust + egui/eframe. Sets the desktop wallpaper to a fixed image
 or a timed slideshow, supports online daily wallpaper and, on Windows/GNOME,
 setting the lock screen image.
